{"seq":3,"slug":"attribute-quality-conflict-resolution","title":"属性数据质量治理与冲突消解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/apparel-size-fit-recommendation-returns-reduction/product-attribute-size-ontology/attribute-quality-conflict-resolution","wordCount":3081,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"属性数据质量治理与冲突消解\">属性数据质量治理与冲突消解</h1><p>一条牛仔裤的臀围属性，在三个系统里写着三个数：供应商 Excel 是 104 cm，3D 扫描建模得出 101.5 cm，质检抽测是 103 cm。三者都在&quot;正确&quot;范围内，但推荐引擎只能拿一个数去和买家臀围求交。属性治理要回答的不是&quot;哪个数对&quot;，而是<strong>这条属性由谁负责、依据什么证据、以什么规则收敛为唯一可计算值</strong>——并且这个收敛过程要能被审计、能被回滚。上一篇 <a href=\"apparel-size-ontology-schema\">服装尺码本体与属性 Schema 设计</a> 把尺码从字符串还原成结构化事实；本篇处理事实本身不可信时的工程问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"属性质量问题的四个来源\">属性质量问题的四个来源</h2><p>把质量问题一律归为&quot;数据脏&quot;会导致治理动作失焦。跨境服装的属性缺陷至少来自四条互不相同的路径，对策也不同。</p>\n<p><strong>多源覆盖冲突</strong>是最常见的一种。同一个 SKU 的属性值由供应商申报、平台类目规范、拍摄/建模测量、历史订单回流四条管道汇入。上游供应商填的是&quot;设计值&quot;，扫描测的是&quot;实物值&quot;，两者在弹力面料上可以合法地差 ±3 cm。这不是错误，而是<strong>两个不同语义的&quot;臀围&quot;被塞进同一个字段</strong>——回到本体设计，这正说明缺少 <code>applies_to</code>（身体维度 vs 成衣维度）与 <code>source</code> 的标注。</p>\n<p><strong>录入与映射污染</strong>来自自由文本。供应商把 <code>170/76A</code> 填进欧码 <code>38</code> 的字段，或把童装码写进成人尺码表。这类污染在符号层无法被发现，只有下降到度量层做区间校验（见前文本体的度量层定义）才会暴露。</p>\n<p><strong>时效衰减</strong>来自尺码表的版本漂移。供应商换批次、改版型、换面料，但商品页的尺码表还是三个月前那份。ISO 8559 与 EN 13402 定义的是<strong>测量程序</strong>，不定义某件商品的当前值；商品页的绝对值必须随批次刷新。</p>\n<p><strong>规则缺口</strong>是治理自身的缺陷：早期没有对&quot;腰围必须小于臀围&quot;&quot;身高码必须落在 140–200 cm 区间&quot;这类领域约束建规则，导致明显不合物理规律的组合被放行。这类缺口只能靠持续补充校验规则来堵。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>典型表现</th>\n<th>检测手段</th>\n<th>消解策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>多源覆盖冲突</td>\n<td>同属性多值并存</td>\n<td>值域比对 + 血缘追踪</td>\n<td>权威源裁定 / 证据加权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>录入映射污染</td>\n<td>跨系统码混用</td>\n<td>度量层区间校验</td>\n<td>归一化 + 拒绝回退</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时效衰减</td>\n<td>尺码表过期</td>\n<td>批次版本比对</td>\n<td>强制刷新 + 时间衰减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则缺口</td>\n<td>违反物理约束</td>\n<td>领域约束规则库</td>\n<td>补规则 + 历史回扫</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-黄金记录-权威源与血缘\">核心概念：黄金记录、权威源与血缘</h2><p>治理术语需要先对齐三个概念，否则后续策略会互相打架。**黄金记录（golden record）**指一个属性在一个 SKU 上唯一的、下游只读的生效值；它不是&quot;最真的值&quot;，而是&quot;当前被裁定为生效的值&quot;，因此必须可被下一次裁定替换。**权威源（authoritative source）**是裁定黄金记录的优先依据，按属性域而非全局指定——成衣维度看质检、身体维度看建模、设计值看供应商，三者不冲突因为语义不同。**血缘（lineage）**记录从候选值到黄金记录的完整变换链，包括裁定规则、权重、操作者与时间。三者共同定义了一个可审计的属性系统：任何生效值都能回答&quot;凭什么&quot;，任何裁定都能被复现或推翻。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可度量的质量维度\">可度量的质量维度</h2><p>治理不能被感受驱动，必须有指标。数据管理领域（DAMA-DMBOK）与 ISO 8000 系列给出的通用质量维度可以直接映射到尺码属性上，只是每个维度都要落到<strong>可计算的服装语义</strong>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>完整性（completeness）</strong>：尺码属性中必填的主维度是否齐备。用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>required</mtext></msub><mo>:</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>required</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\frac{|\\{a \\in A_{\\text{required}} : v(a) \\neq \\emptyset\\}|}{|A_{\\text{required}}|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5862em;vertical-align:-0.5481em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0381em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">required</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5131em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">required</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\"><span class=\"mord vbox mtight\"><span class=\"thinbox mtight\"><span class=\"rlap mtight\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak mtight\"></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∅</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">}</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 度量。</li>\n<li><strong>一致性（consistency）</strong>：跨系统同属性值是否落在彼此的可接受容差内。对弹力面料，容差本身应是面料相关的函数，而非全局常数。</li>\n<li><strong>准确性（accuracy）</strong>：属性值是否与实物测量一致。以质检抽测为金标，用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>∑</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>declared</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>measured</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MAE = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum |v_{\\text{declared}} - v_{\\text{measured}}|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">declared</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">measured</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 衡量。</li>\n<li><strong>时效性（timeliness）</strong>：<code>updated_at</code> 与批次切换时间的差。超过一个采购周期即判衰减。</li>\n<li><strong>唯一性（uniqueness）</strong>：同一属性在一个 SKU 上是否只有一个权威值（黄金记录原则）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把这五个维度做成每个 SKU 的属性健康分，就能把治理从&quot;逐条修&quot;变成&quot;按分数排序修&quot;。这也是平台侧的动力所在——Google Merchant Center 的商品数据规范要求服装类目提供 <code>size</code>、<code>size_system</code>、<code>size_type</code>，缺失或非法会直接导致商品被否决（disapproval），属性质量在这里已经是<strong>投放资格</strong>问题，而不只是推荐精度问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冲突检测-规则优先-统计兜底\">冲突检测：规则优先，统计兜底</h2><p>检测分两层。<strong>规则层</strong>是可枚举的领域约束，写成谓词，全部可解释：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>SizeAttributes</mtext><mo>:</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>valid</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><munderover><mo>⋀</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall s \\in \\text{SizeAttributes}:\\quad \\text{valid}(s) \\iff \\bigwedge_{k=1}^{n} r_k(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SizeAttributes</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">valid</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9535em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">⋀</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>规则库至少应覆盖：单位一致性（cm 与 in 不可混存）、区间不重叠（同一尺码系统的相邻档位区间不可交叠）、单调性（尺码序列沿主维度单调递增）、物理约束（腰围 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span></span></span></span></span> 臀围；胸围 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span></span></span></span></span> 0）、以及本体层已定义的 <code>applies_to</code> 标注存在性。</p>\n<p><strong>统计层</strong>处理规则抓不到的异常——规则说&quot;104 cm 合法&quot;，但该 SKU 所在品类臀围分布的中位数是 98 cm，104 出现在 3σ 之外。用稳健统计量而非均值标准差，因为异常值本身会污染后者：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mtext>median</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1.4826</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>MAD</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>MAD</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>median</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mtext>median</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_i = \\frac{v_i - \\text{median}(V)}{1.4826 \\cdot \\text{MAD}(V)},\\qquad \\text{MAD}(V) = \\text{median}(|v_i - \\text{median}(V)|)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1.4826</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAD</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">median</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAD</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">median</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">median</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.4826</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.4826</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.4826</span></span></span></span></span> 使 MAD 在正态假设下与标准差对齐。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|z_i| &gt; 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 的属性进入人工复核队列，而不是被自动删除——统计异常可能是真缺陷，也可能是新品类尚未纳入基线。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[属性进入管道] --&gt; B{规则层校验}&#10;    B --&gt;|违规| C[标记 conflict&lt;br/&gt;附违规规则 id]&#10;    B --&gt;|通过| D{统计层异常检测}&#10;    D --&gt;|z 超阈值| E[进入人工复核队列]&#10;    D --&gt;|正常| F[进入消解阶段]&#10;    C --&gt; G{多源冲突?}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[按权威源裁定]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| I[按容差归一]&#10;    H --&gt; F&#10;    I --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt;|人工确认| F&#10;    E --&gt;|驳回| J[回退到上一版本]\">graph TD\n    A[属性进入管道] --&gt; B{规则层校验}\n    B --&gt;|违规| C[标记 conflict&lt;br/&gt;附违规规则 id]\n    B --&gt;|通过| D{统计层异常检测}\n    D --&gt;|z 超阈值| E[进入人工复核队列]\n    D --&gt;|正常| F[进入消解阶段]\n    C --&gt; G{多源冲突?}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[按权威源裁定]\n    G --&gt;|否| I[按容差归一]\n    H --&gt; F\n    I --&gt; F\n    E --&gt;|人工确认| F\n    E --&gt;|驳回| J[回退到上一版本]</pre><h2 id=\"冲突消解策略-从权威源到证据加权\">冲突消解策略：从权威源到证据加权</h2><p>消解的本质是在多个候选值中选一个，并留下选择依据。四种策略按可靠性递增排列。</p>\n<p><strong>权威源优先（authoritative source）</strong>：为每个属性域预先指定唯一的权威系统。质检抽测数据是实物的直接证据，通常应作为成衣维度的最高权威；供应商申报对设计值有权威；扫描建模对身体维度有权威。这是最低成本、最高可解释性的策略，也是主数据管理（MDM）里&quot;黄金记录&quot;的标准做法。</p>\n<p><strong>时序优先（temporal）</strong>：取最近变更的值。适用于批次驱动的量，缺陷是&quot;最近&quot;不等于&quot;最准&quot;——一次错误录入也会被当成最新。</p>\n<p><strong>证据加权（evidence weighting）</strong>：给每个来源一个可信度权重，取加权中位数。权重需要周期性用质检金标校准：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>v</mi></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{v} = \\arg\\min_{v} \\sum_{i} w_i \\cdot \\rho\\!\\left(\\frac{v_i - v}{\\sigma_i}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 用 Huber 损失替代平方损失，使单个离群来源不能拉偏结果。这正是&quot;用统计代替裁判&quot;的边界：权重可解释、可回滚，比黑箱模型更适合承受审计。</p>\n<p><strong>人工仲裁（arbitration）</strong>：当权威源缺失、或统计权重接近时，路由到品类运营。人工结论必须回写为<strong>新规则</strong>或<strong>新权重</strong>，否则同样冲突会反复触达人工，治理成本不收敛。</p>\n<p>实际系统通常是分层的：先权威源，未命中则证据加权，仍不确定才人工。GS1 的 GDSN（Global Data Synchronisation Network）就是这个模式的行业化版本——它把属性校验规则标准化，让卖方与买方在同一套规则下交换并校验商品数据，冲突在进入买方系统之前就被标注，而不是等到商品页出问题才追。</p>\n<h2 id=\"治理机制-责任-血缘与版本\">治理机制：责任、血缘与版本</h2><p>消解策略只解决&quot;当下选哪个&quot;，治理机制解决&quot;以后不再反复出问题&quot;。三件事是必须的。</p>\n<p><strong>属性责任矩阵</strong>。每个属性域必须有唯一的数据拥有者（data owner）。尺码属性横跨供应商、质检、算法三个团队，如果不指定 owner，冲突就会在组织缝隙里长期存活。owner 不负责逐条修数，负责定义权威源与容差。</p>\n<p><strong>数据血缘（lineage）</strong>。每个生效值都要能回答&quot;它从哪来、经过哪些变换、被谁改过&quot;。血缘是冲突消解可审计的前提——没有血缘，&quot;证据加权&quot;就退化成又一次不可解释的覆盖。</p>\n<p><strong>版本与回滚</strong>。属性变更必须版本化，且与批次绑定。当质检发现新版尺码表有系统性偏差时，回滚必须能在一操作内完成，而不是逐条改回。这与本体层的版本属性一致：本体定义结构稳定性，属性值承担实例的易变性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    S1[供应商申报] --&gt; RAW[原始层&lt;br/&gt;保留全部候选值]&#10;    S2[扫描建模] --&gt; RAW&#10;    S3[质检抽测] --&gt; RAW&#10;    RAW --&gt; DET[检测: 规则 + 统计]&#10;    DET --&gt; RES[消解: 权威/加权/人工]&#10;    RES --&gt; GOLD[黄金记录&lt;br/&gt;单一生效值 + 血缘]&#10;    GOLD --&gt; CONS[下游消费: 推荐/检索/投放]&#10;    CONS --&gt; FB[回流反馈: 退货归因]&#10;    FB --&gt; W[校准权重与容差]&#10;    W --&gt; RES\">flowchart TD\n    S1[供应商申报] --&gt; RAW[原始层&lt;br/&gt;保留全部候选值]\n    S2[扫描建模] --&gt; RAW\n    S3[质检抽测] --&gt; RAW\n    RAW --&gt; DET[检测: 规则 + 统计]\n    DET --&gt; RES[消解: 权威/加权/人工]\n    RES --&gt; GOLD[黄金记录&lt;br/&gt;单一生效值 + 血缘]\n    GOLD --&gt; CONS[下游消费: 推荐/检索/投放]\n    CONS --&gt; FB[回流反馈: 退货归因]\n    FB --&gt; W[校准权重与容差]\n    W --&gt; RES</pre><p>图里最关键的是 <code>RAW</code> 节点：<strong>原始层永远保留全部候选值，绝不覆盖</strong>。只存生效值会让血缘断裂，也会让后续的权重校准失去训练数据。反馈回路 <code>FB → W</code> 把尺码相关退货的真实结果注入治理——这是属性治理与退货治理两个子系统唯一的正确连接点，而不是让运营坐在中间手工对数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与合身推荐的连接\">与合身推荐的连接</h2><p>属性治理的产出物不是&quot;干净的数据库&quot;，而是一个<strong>可计算的置信区间</strong>。推荐引擎需要的不是臀围 = 103 cm 这个点值，而是&quot;103 ± 2 cm，来源为质检，置信度高&quot;。当置信度低时，推荐系统应当扩大推荐尺码范围或直接降级到保守推荐，把不确定性暴露给买家，而不是假装确定。</p>\n<p>这解释了为什么治理必须在推荐之前完成：一个连属性真值都不确定的系统，其推荐精度上限由属性质量决定，模型再好也无法突破。把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MAE</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 作为推荐系统的输入特征之一，让模型知道&quot;这条数据有多可信&quot;，比无条件信任所有属性值要稳健得多。属性质量与推荐质量之间不是并列关系，而是<strong>上游与下游</strong>的因果关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"落地检查清单\">落地检查清单</h2><ul>\n<li>每个尺码属性域已指定唯一 data owner，并明确权威源</li>\n<li>原始候选值全量保留，生效值经消解产生且附带血缘</li>\n<li>规则库覆盖单位、区间、单调、物理约束四类</li>\n<li>统计层用稳健统计量（MAD 而非标准差），阈值可配置</li>\n<li>人工仲裁结论必须回写为规则或权重，禁止只改单条数据</li>\n<li>属性健康分（完整性/一致性/准确性/时效性/唯一性）可查询、可按 SKU 排序</li>\n<li>属性变更与批次绑定，支持一操作回滚</li>\n<li>退货归因结果回流校准容差与来源权重</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>属性数据质量治理的本质，是把&quot;哪个值对&quot;这个无法直接回答的问题，转化为&quot;由谁、依据什么证据、按什么规则裁定&quot;这个可执行的流程。它与上游的尺码本体互为表里：本体定义属性应当有哪些字段（<code>applies_to</code>、<code>source</code>、<code>interval</code>），治理才可能检测出&quot;两个语义被塞进同一字段&quot;这类根本冲突。它又为下游的合身推荐提供置信区间而非点值，让推荐系统的不确定性可被显式建模。原始候选值全量保留、生效值经消解且附血缘、人工结论必须回写为规则——这三条构成了一个不会随规模失控的治理闭环。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"属性数据质量治理与冲突消解","id":"属性数据质量治理与冲突消解"},{"level":2,"text":"属性质量问题的四个来源","id":"属性质量问题的四个来源"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：黄金记录、权威源与血缘","id":"核心概念-黄金记录-权威源与血缘"},{"level":2,"text":"可度量的质量维度","id":"可度量的质量维度"},{"level":2,"text":"冲突检测：规则优先，统计兜底","id":"冲突检测-规则优先-统计兜底"},{"level":2,"text":"冲突消解策略：从权威源到证据加权","id":"冲突消解策略-从权威源到证据加权"},{"level":2,"text":"治理机制：责任、血缘与版本","id":"治理机制-责任-血缘与版本"},{"level":2,"text":"与合身推荐的连接","id":"与合身推荐的连接"},{"level":2,"text":"落地检查清单","id":"落地检查清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"商品属性抽取与标准化流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/apparel-size-fit-recommendation-returns-reduction/product-attribute-size-ontology/attribute-extraction-normalization-pipeline"},"next":{"title":"合身问答与体型画像采集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/apparel-size-fit-recommendation-returns-reduction/tryon-guidance-ux/fit-quiz-body-profile-capture"}}